text @[Kouko]
text Not really. We can still talk if it won't take long.
text @[Tomoya]
text Then I'll keep it short.
text @[Tomoya]
text Actually, I have a request today.
sound 4E6.aac
text @[Kouko]
text Please go ahead.
text @[Tomoya]
text Next Monday, the Founder Festival will be held at our school.
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, it's sort of like a school festival...
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKO11"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
bgload {$strS[1000]}.jpg 30
