text @[Kouko]
text Yes, I know about it.
text Obviously, I don't need to explain it to her. She should know about it more than I do.
text @[Tomoya]
text Could you please come to the festival?
setvar strS[1001] = "CGKO13"
setvar intF[1113] = intF[1112]
