text Huh? Me?
text @[Tomoya]
text Yes, Kouko-san. We really want you to come.
sound 4E9.aac
text @[Kouko]
text Is there... something there?
text @[Tomoya]
text No, nothing in particular.
text @[Tomoya]
text Just that, if you could spend the day with {$lnmA}...
text I wonder if that's enough to convince her...
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, and I'd be there, too.
text I really want her to come.
text @[Tomoya]
text There should be a lot of fun stuff, like the booths. So please come.
sound 4EA.aac
text @[Kouko]
text ...
text @[Tomoya]
text Is it not possible?
